## Versioning + build workflow

- **Source of truth** for version is `drawio/VERSION` (submodule), not `package.json`.
- Run **`npm run sync`** before packaging/releasing; it syncs the version and
  generates any derived artifacts.
- Be careful changing `electron-builder-*.json` and `build/` assets: they affect
  signing/notarization and platform packaging behavior.

## Git / commit message conventions

- Branches: target **`dev`** for development; releases on `release` / `releases/v*.*.*`.
- Commit messages: **sentence style, lower-case, no trailing period**.
- If referencing issues, use `[jgraph/drawio-desktop#NNNN]` in the subject.

## Release docs

- Follow [`doc/RELEASE_PROCESS.md`](mdc:doc/RELEASE_PROCESS.md) when in doubt; prefer
  documenting release-impacting changes alongside code changes.
